Welcome to A sprawling metropolis built on top of a massive, ancient tree's roots, with clockwork machines and steam-powered contraptions replacing traditional architecture in Industrial Revolution era.

As David, you set foot on the night-lit cobblestones, gazing up at the towering network of gears and iron, wood and brass, all intertwined with towering roots of an ancient tree. Steam rises from seemingly hidden veins of the metropolis, filling the air with a warm mist that blankets the city. You can hear the rhythmic tick-tocks that seem to sync with the beating heart of this colossal living machine. Sounds of iron meeting iron echo as craftsmen work on their steam-powered inventions in the safety of the tree's gigantic roots. Your journey through the city, however, is not a pursuit of wonder but of necessity. You were told of a rare clockwork artifact that is said to possess the power to forge, or dismantle, entire realities. Your mission is to locate it before it falls into the wrong hands.


--- Chapter 2 ---


